      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="left" padding="0 0 10px" color="#6B7280" font-size="11px">Photo: GatorBait Media</mj-text>
        <mj-text align="left" padding="0 0 8px" color="#101820" font-size="28px" font-weight="800" line-height="1.15"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/gators-bitten-in-atlanta-four-turnovers-sink-florida-in-27-8-loss-to-no-3-georgia?utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=magazine_postgame_2026_11_02_v2&utm_content=recap_headline" style="color:#101820;text-decoration:none;">Gators Bitten in Atlanta: Four Turnovers Sink Florida in 27-8 Loss to No. 3 Georgia</a></mj-text>
        <mj-text align="left" padding="0 0 14px" font-size="16px">Florida stayed in the game for a quarter, then gave Georgia 24 points off turnovers and penalties before halftime.</mj-text>
        <mj-button align="left" href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/gators-bitten-in-atlanta-four-turnovers-sink-florida-in-27-8-loss-to-no-3-georgia?utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=magazine_postgame_2026_11_02_v2&utm_content=recap_button">READ THE RECAP</mj-button>
