        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px" color="#101820" font-size="21px" font-weight="800" line-height="1.15"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/take-a-deep-breath-it-s-basketball-season-or-wait-a-minute-they-didn-t-drop-out-of-the-top-25-yet?utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=magazine_postgame_2026_11_02_v2&utm_content=hoops_headline" style="color:#101820;text-decoration:none;">Take a Deep Breath. It&#8217;s Basketball Season.</a></mj-text>
