        <mj-text align="center" padding="0 0 14px" color="#0B1F4B" font-size="16px" line-height="1.7">Basketball: No. 1 Florida vs. No. 14 Miami, Monday, Nov. 2, 6 p.m. ET, ESPN2, Tampa<br />Football: Oklahoma at Florida, Saturday, Nov. 7, 7:45 p.m. ET, SEC Network</mj-text>
